    <description>06/04/26 (GD) – Replaces DLRS dlrs__LookupRollupSummary2.Loaner_Assets_Serial (on update). Concatenates Loaner_Serial__c from child Loaner_Asset__c records onto Loaner__c.Loaner_Serial__c. No delimiter; sorted by LastModifiedDate ASC; null serials excluded; 255-char truncation guard. Handles reparenting: updates both new and old parent when Loaner__c changes. Known gap: if Loaner__c is cleared to null, the old parent is not recalculated (entry criteria require Loaner__c to be non-null post-update). Bulk note: concurrent updates on the same parent may cause row-lock contention at very high volume.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>Loaner_Changed_Formula</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>NOT({!$Record.Loaner__c} = {!$Record__Prior.Loaner__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Trimmed_Serial</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>LEFT({!Concatenated_Serial}, 255)</expression>
    </formulas>
